  "headline": "This update introduces support for comments in saved API response examples, which may impact how response bodies are parsed and formatted.",
  "what_changed": "The application now supports JSON-with-comments (JSONC) in saved REST and GraphQL response examples, allowing users to include comments that persist through formatting, saving, and downloading. A new prettify button has been added to editable response bodies, and the system now validates JSONC input to prevent malformed data from being silently altered.",
